#: src/borrowing/exercise.md:6
msgid "Exercise: Wizard's Inventory"
msgstr ""

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md:8
msgid ""
"In this exercise, you will manage a wizard's inventory using what you have "
"learned about borrowing and ownership."
msgstr ""

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md:11
msgid ""
"The wizard has a collection of spells. You need to implement functions to "
"add spells to the inventory and to cast spells from them."
msgstr ""

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md:14
msgid ""
"Spells have a limited number of uses. When a spell has no uses left, it must "
"be removed from the wizard's inventory."
msgstr ""

